---
import DirectButton from "../../GlobalComponents/DirectButton/DirectButton";
---

<div
  class="overflow-hidden relative bg-zinc-900 py-2 px-5 md:px-5 lg:px-15 w-full min-h-[90vh] md:min-h-[100vh] flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-14 justify-evenly md:justify-between items-center transition-all duration-400"
>
  <div
    class="w-full h-full bg-zinc-800 absolute md:top-0 md:left-1/2 lg:left-1/2 md:bottom-0 -bottom-[30rem] md:rounded-full rounded-[10rem] [box-shadow:0_0_6px_2px_#F2E5BF]"
  >
  </div>
  <!-- Short Desc -->
  <div class="z-10">
    <h1
      class="text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl text-center md:text-left font-normal"
    >
      e-Lapor
    </h1>
    <p
      class="text-white text-md md:text-lg text-center md:text-left font-thin pt-3"
    >
      Tentang e-Lapor
    </p>
    <p
      class="text-white text-md md:text-xl font-thin max-w-lg md:max-w-sm lg:max-w-sm text-center md:text-justify"
    >
      Platform ini dirancang untuk memfasilitasi pelaporan temuan di lingkungan
      sekolah dan mengelolanya dalam satu sistem terintegrasi, guna
      <b
        >mendukung melihat, menganalisis dan pengambilan keputusan berbasis
        data.
      </b>
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center md:justify-start justify-center mt-4 md:mt-5">
      <DirectButton label="Laporkan Sekarang!" client:only />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Img -->
  <div
    class="w-[80vw] h-[40vh] md:w-[30vw] md:h-[40vh] bg-[#F2E5BF] shadow-lg shadow-gray-600 md:py-6 md:px-2 py-12 px-6 rounded-xl relative"
  >
    <div>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-red-600 rounded-full absolute top-2 left-2"
      ></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full absolute top-2 left-6"
      ></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-500 rounded-full absolute top-2 left-10"
      ></span>
      <span
        class="text-center text-[#F2E5BF] font-semibold text-sm absolute top-0.5 left-0 right-0"
        >Report Form</span
      >
    </div>
    <img
      src="/img/reportScreenshot.png"
      class="w-fit h-full mx-auto object-cover aspect-square rounded-xl"
      alt=""
    />
  </div>
</div>
